Cell["\<\
The StandardForm notation \[OuterProduct] (unicode char  :0x22CF, not to be \
confused with Wedge[]) is defined my modifying  UnicodeSymbols.tr file. Here \
we also determine  the operation precedence, which is 450. 
The following properties defined for arbitrary elements:\
